[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16863.43, "timestamp": "04:41:03", "text": "最后。哦，我看到我的东西了。是的。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16866.39, "timestamp": "04:41:06", "text": "你也看到了我的东西吗？是的，我看到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16878.628, "timestamp": "04:41:18", "text": "有一群暴徒在攻击我，但我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16881.59, "timestamp": "04:41:21", "text": "看不到它的攻击。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16886.23, "timestamp": "04:41:26", "text": "什么？对，就是那个发射弹丸的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16890.868, "timestamp": "04:41:30", "text": "哦，它采用的是不同的技术。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16894.868, "timestamp": "04:41:34", "text": "等等，我的坏机在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16897.43, "timestamp": "04:41:37", "text": "那是我的死盒子。你的就像向上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16903.11, "timestamp": "04:41:43", "text": "过来。过来。我来给你演示一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16911.75, "timestamp": "04:41:51", "text": "乔，你想完成我们……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16914.07, "timestamp": "04:41:54", "text": "开始了？你还想继续吗？是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16916.708, "timestamp": "04:41:56", "text": "是的。是的。是的。是的。我们已经死了"}]